# When to publish

While the app is only running on this machine for local development, leave changes uncommitted until Alastair asks.

Once the Docker container is installed on the live machine, a change he needs to run must be committed and pushed to `main`. Pushing is what builds `ghcr.io/tyesamson/vandros-gateway:latest`. He then removes the old container and runs his script, which uses `--pull always`.

Do not commit `config.yaml`, secrets, or private mount names. Do not force-push unless he asks after being warned.
